WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.593 --> 00:00:05.211
Tom wanted to play hopscotch.

2
00:00:07.628 --> 00:00:11.459
"Let's play!" he called to Jim.

3
00:00:14.762 --> 00:00:19.097
So Tom hopped and Jim watched.

4
00:00:34.891 --> 00:00:39.550
Then Jim hopped and Tom watched.

5
00:00:43.024 --> 00:00:46.143
Kate wanted to play too.

6
00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:50.012
"Let me play!" she begged.

7
00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:56.837
So Kate jumped and the boys

8
00:01:07.612 --> 00:01:10.685
watched. Joy wanted to play

9
00:01:11.152 --> 00:01:14.513
too. But she needed a bean

10
00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:22.643
bag. Kate tossed Joy a bean

11
00:01:23.528 --> 00:01:27.326
bag. "Let her play!" Kate

12
00:01:31.521 --> 00:01:36.537
shouted. So Joy jumped and everyone

13
00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:40.755
watched. "I win!" Joy

14
00:01:41.056 --> 00:01:45.263
cried. Everyone

15
00:01:46.057 --> 00:02:16.510
cheered.

